== Gameplay ==
[[File:Options_Gameplay.png|thumb]]
=== Advanced options ===
'''Show tutorials''' - when enabled, tutorials will be displayed when first using certain features (e.g. there is a short tutorial when first entering the Unity tab). Experienced players may wish to disable this to save a few clicks.

'''Reset speed on warp''' - sets the Time Flux [[Time_Flux#Game_Speed|Game Speed]] to x1 every time you perform a [[Time_Flux#Time_Warp|Time Warp]].

'''One click to Prestige''' - changes the default 5-click confirmation for Prestige to a single click.

'''One click to enter challenge''' - changes the default 3-click confirmation for entering an {{Keyword|inf|Infinity Challenge}} to a single click.

'''Prevent Zodiac Unity reset''' - disables the popup confirmation window warning of a {{Keyword|unity|Unity reset}} that appears every time you move a Zodiac.

'''{{Keyword|inf|Infinite}}/{{Keyword|eternity|Eternate}}/{{Keyword|unity|Unite}}''' safety lock - disables the ability to click/press the {{Keyword|inf|Infinite}}/{{Keyword|eternity|Eternate}}/{{Keyword|unity|Unite}} buttons. Can be helpful to prevent accidentally pressing these buttons at some stages of the game.

=== Hotkeys (Desktop only) ===
- Enables [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keyboard_shortcut hotkeys]

'''Default states''':

Buy all upgrades: [B] <br>
Ascend all upgrades: [A] <br>
Apply the Prestige: [P] <br>

<nowiki>#</nowiki>1 Mult Gain Mult: [1] <br>
<nowiki>#</nowiki>2 Laps Speed Mult: [2] <br>
<nowiki>#</nowiki>3 Ascension Power: [3] <br>
<nowiki>#</nowiki>4 Promotions Power: [4]

Macro State:
* Stop: [S]
* Play: [M]
* Pause: [N]

'''Reset Hotkeys''' - resets all key bindings to the above defaults. <!-- who would've thunk it-->

